# ONNX Runtime for the preferred (not admitted) speaker-encoder candidate.
# Installed --no-deps, like mlx-whisper: numpy comes from the alpha lock, and
# InferenceSession creation plus inference were verified to run with numpy
# alone — none of onnxruntime's other declared dependencies is even imported
# on that path (checked against the exported ECAPA artifact, 2026-08-03).
# Regenerate with MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET=14.4 prefixed to the uv command in
# the lock header: the wheel's platform floor is macosx_14_0, above uv's
# default assumption, and the app's own minimum system version is 14.4.
onnxruntime==1.28.0
